  m_text: 'Grounders is a popular Canadian schoolyard game, one player is "It" and
    plays with their eyes closed.


    The players have to move carefully around
    them and not get tagged,  if the "It" player believes there is someone on the
    ground, calling "Grounders!" causes them to be tagged.'
